Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 06:07:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] thumbnail: isencryptedpackage

OplusCamera's isEncryptedPackage helper (f6/l0->l) goes through
com.oplus.app.OPlusAccessControlManager. AxionAOSP or any other AOSP rom resolves that against the
oplus-fwk stub in hardware/oplus, whose isEncryptedPackage() returns true
unconditionally, so every package reads as private-safe media and ThumbnailUI
clears the last-shot thumbnail.

Symptom on avalon: take a photo and the thumbnail appears; tap it to open the
gallery, come back, and the thumbnail is a flat grey placeholder until the next
capture.

Short-circuit the helper to false. Ported from the aston/OP12R tree
(patches/0002, d6/g0->l there); obfuscation moved the class to f6/l0 on avalon

Change-Id: I074eb60ebb9ade9aa5166b7792b2ea028f37d7f7
Signed-off-by: EternalMikaelson <klaus_mikaelson@rediffmail.com>
